<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Returns all objects enclosed by a specific shape. 
</p><p>Parameter Info for generic parameters fA, fB, fC:
</p>
<ul><li>SPHERE:    fA = radius (meters)</li>
<li>CONE:      fA = angle (degrees), fB = length (meters)</li></ul>
